* Task 6 fixture: GET data-access extraction
* Contains GET EMPLOYEES (#ISN) and GET SAME to prove that:
* - GET with a valid operand produces one EdgeReads entry
* - GET SAME (no operand) produces NO entry (modeled gap: read with no resolvable file/DDM name)

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 EMPLOYEES-ISN (N9)
END DEFINE

READ EMPLOYEES

GET EMPLOYEES (#EMPLOYEES-ISN)

GET SAME

END

